Suggests:
 sonic-pi-server-doc
Description: Backend server for Sonic Pi
 The Sonic Pi backend server drives the built-in SuperSonic audio engine to
 play synths and samples. Advanced users may want to use the server for
 experiments without the graphical user interface provided by the sonic-pi
 package.

